  "summary": "I am a software engineer based out of San Diego and worked at Qualcomm for almost 10 years after receiving my masters at UCSD\n\nAt Qualcomm I worked on a centralized Static Analysis team who were responsible for integrating various SA tools (Klocwork/Parasoft/Coverity) to the various nightly/incremental build systems for the org's business units. The team also was responsible for centralized reporting/tracking portals along with various web services.\n\nMy personal skillset is\n- Full stack development (Python, C#, database stuff, Angular based web dev)\n- Deep knowledge of the administrative aspects of various SA tools\n- Deep knowledge of various compliance standards (Misra 2012, Autosar, CERT\n\nOutside of work I am an avid hiker seeking to visit all of the cool peaks/attractions both around where I live and beyond.",
