    "description": "Staff Engineer in Qualcomm Static Analysis team.\nThis team was responsible for\n- Integrating Static Analysis tooling (Klocwork/Parasoft. Coverity in the past) into Qualcomm nightly and Incremental build processes\n- Providing engineering/management with relevant reports on Static Analysis\n- Other related tooling for code analysis (Code Coverage, Tracking Source Lines of Code, Tracking Compiler Warnings)\n\nThis role can be considered full stack development. As it encompassed\n- Python Automation to run on the various build systems\n- C# Web services to support the client side automation\n- SqlServer database to support the web services\n- Cshtml/angular based reports for customer reporting\n- IT Adjacent work related to maintaining the various static analysis tools.\n\nIn this position I have substantial administrative/automation experience with\n- Klocwork Security related checkers, such as array bounds violations\n- Klocwork, 9 years experience\n- Parasoft Compliance Standards. Specifically MISRA 2012, CERT, Autosar. As well as their code coverage offering\n- Parasoft ~5 years experience\n\nI Have Passing Experience with\nCoverity - Security related checkers/analysis (Passing experience as the license lapsed and I only directly worked with this tool for a year)",
